# Department manager RBAC (nihas V1.0.26, audit 2026-10-29).
# 1. department_manager_allowlist_and_scope:
#    - manager_department_surfaces(dept): a manager may switch only their department's preset toggles
#      (mirrors lib/memberSurfaces.ts managerEditableSurfaceIds; pinned by rbac.departmentManager.test.ts).
#    - set_member_surfaces_as_manager re-created: org resolved from the target member, every key checked
#      against the allowlist and boolean, active non-owner/admin/driver same-department target; anon EXECUTE revoked.
#    - can_manage_member(member) + set_member_scope_as_manager(member, warehouses[], clients[]):
#      Ground Ops / Sourcing managers assign teammates' scope from their own scope only.
#    - organization_member_warehouses: writes owner/admin only (was any staff); managers read teammates' rows.
# Functions and policies only; no table or data changes.
#
# Re-creates set_member_surfaces_as_manager after 20270304022000 (already on prod and preprod). On a fresh
# local reset this file sorts first and 20270304022000 would overwrite the function — apply via this set only.
